name: Coalesced Escape/navigation and literal paste remain distinct
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY OPENROUTER_API_KEY GEMINI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/terminal_keyboard.py @TMP_TARGET @ART seed @TMP_HOME
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | ready
type: held α
require-live-snap: 20 held α | held
keys: Escape End
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | escape-end
expect-not: [4~
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/terminal_keyboard.py @TMP_TARGET @ART escape-end
type: repeated α
require-live-snap: 20 repeated α | before-repeated-escape
keys: Escape Escape
require-live-snap: 20 NAVIGATE | repeated-escape
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | repeated-return
type: [4~
require-live-snap: 20 › [4~ | typed-literal
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/terminal_keyboard.py @TMP_TARGET @ART typed-literal
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | clear-literal
paste-file: @ART/literal-paste.txt
require-live-snap: 20 inspect paste | pasted
expect: Esc dismiss
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 Esc clear | paste-notice-cleared
keys: C-y
require-live-snap: 20 [4~ literal | literal-inspection
expect: first α
expect: last β
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/terminal_keyboard.py @TMP_TARGET @ART literal-inspection
ask: Is the End sequence absent after batched Escape/End while the same literal text remains intact when typed or pasted?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 inspect paste | inspection-return
type: ud
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | appended
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | draft-40x12
keys: C-y
require-live-snap: 20 [4~ literal | compact-inspection
expect: Esc cancel
ask: Do the final dependency changes preserve the six-size paste controls, appended draft and compact inspection?
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 chars⟫ud | compact-return
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | compact-clear
resize: 120x36
type: quit
require-live-snap: 20 › quit | quit
keys: Enter
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | no-color-ready
type: held β
require-live-snap: 20 held β | no-color-held
keys: Escape End
require-live-snap: 20 describe what to map | no-color-escape-end
expect-not: [4~
ask: Does no-color restart retain normal input and avoid the coalesced sequence corruption without starting investigation work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/terminal_keyboard.py @TMP_TARGET @ART no-color-escape-end
